# Complete architecture-neutral firmware BOM for the NCZ-OS offline closure.
#
# Every binary package named firmware-* published by the configured Debian
# suite for our supported architectures belongs here.  Keep exclusions in
# firmware-bom.allow instead of silently omitting them.
